            {"question":"An older adult leaks urine whenever she coughs, laughs, or lifts a heavy object. Which type of urinary incontinence is MOST likely?","options":["Urge incontinence","Overflow incontinence","Stress incontinence","Functional incontinence"],"answer":"Stress incontinence"},
