            {"question":"Which environmental modification BEST facilitates continence?","options":["Clear path to the bathroom with nightlights and grab bars","Increasing obstacles between the patient and bathroom","Removing all bathroom aids","Using difficult-to-remove clothing"],"answer":"Clear path to the bathroom with nightlights and grab bars"},
