            {"question":"According to the WHO, a fall is defined as:","options":["Any accident resulting in a fracture","An unexpected event in which a person comes to rest on the ground or lower level","Sudden loss of consciousness only","Slipping inside the bathroom only"],"answer":"An unexpected event in which a person comes to rest on the ground or lower level"},
            {"question":"How many individuals die from falls globally each year?","options":["100,000","300,000","646,000","1,000,000"],"answer":"646,000"},
