            {"question":"Which of the following is an intrinsic (personal) risk factor for falls?","options":["Dim lighting","Slippery floors","Use of sedatives, antihypertensives, or diuretics","Loose rugs"],"answer":"Use of sedatives, antihypertensives, or diuretics"},
