            {"question":"A pressure ulcer is best defined as:","options":["A skin inflammation caused by heat","An injury to the skin and/or underlying tissue from pressure or shear, usually over a bony prominence","A wound caused by bacterial infection only","Ulcers resulting from medication side effects"],"answer":"An injury to the skin and/or underlying tissue from pressure or shear, usually over a bony prominence"},
