            {"question":"The primary nursing role in primary prevention of pressure ulcers is to:","options":["Wait for erythema to appear before intervening","Reduce friction, minimize moisture, reposition patients, and redistribute body weight","Apply topical antibiotics routinely","Use compression bandages always"],"answer":"Reduce friction, minimize moisture, reposition patients, and redistribute body weight"},
